  "details": "Description of the bug:\nWhile set correctly in the FBX and Avatar Descriptor, the 'E' and 'ih' visemes appear to be showing in each other's place in-game. This was with a Valve Index and the Steam version of VRC, in VR mode.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Wear an avatar with known, noticably-different 'E' and 'ih' visemes\n2. Speak these phonemes and observe which viseme is shown\nVideo of bug:\nhttps://youtu.be/ORj2e78hkQU\nNote: I've checked the Avatar Descriptor in Debug mode and can't see anything wrong there either.",
